WEBVTT

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:22.772
Produced by Bandai Visual,
Shelty, Mad House

00:00:44.293 --> 00:00:45.878
It's coming, Sakura!

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:11.279
This is bad!

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:16.200
God of Thunder, I call thee!

00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:22.415
Thank you, Li!

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.333
Don't take your eyes off it!

00:01:29.297 --> 00:01:31.382
- Now!
- Yeah!

00:01:37.346 --> 00:01:40.391
Wind, become a binding chain!

00:01:41.809 --> 00:01:43.394
WINDY!

00:01:55.031 --> 00:01:56.616
JUMP!

00:02:04.749 --> 00:02:09.086
Return to the guise that you
were meant to be in! CLOW CARD!

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:37.239
Just a little more, and Shaoran
would have gotten the card!

00:02:37.907 --> 00:02:40.117
You're so cute, Sakura.

00:02:41.452 --> 00:02:47.208
All right! Well done! Only the champion
I chose could be this awesome, right...?

00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:49.126
...Cardcaptor Sakura!

00:02:52.338 --> 00:03:02.306
Cardcaptor Sakura: The Movie

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.381
Where am I?

00:04:18.883 --> 00:04:20.468
Water...?

00:04:46.368 --> 00:04:50.164
Huh? I can breathe.

00:04:55.878 --> 00:04:59.924
Water is a thing that flows.

00:05:10.893 --> 00:05:15.439
Water is a thing that flows.

00:05:38.128 --> 00:05:39.713
A dream...?

00:05:47.888 --> 00:05:49.807
- Nishimura.
- Here!

00:05:51.892 --> 00:05:53.811
- Kobayashi.
- Here!

00:05:55.354 --> 00:05:56.939
Well done.

00:05:57.815 --> 00:05:59.942
- Kondo!
- Here!

00:05:59.942 --> 00:06:01.902
Let's try a little harder next time.

00:06:03.404 --> 00:06:05.781
- Shimizu!
- Here!

00:06:05.781 --> 00:06:07.283
How did you do?

00:06:07.283 --> 00:06:11.287
I made it! I was afraid my
math grade might have dropped.

00:06:11.287 --> 00:06:13.122
That's good!

00:06:13.122 --> 00:06:15.207
- Daidouiji.
- Here!

00:06:16.876 --> 00:06:18.794
- Nomura.
- Here!

00:06:23.465 --> 00:06:25.384
Are you worried about
your grades, too, Li?

00:06:26.719 --> 00:06:28.304
N- Not really.

00:06:28.304 --> 00:06:31.223
It's okay! I'm with you!

00:06:31.974 --> 00:06:35.102
Oh, I get it. You don't
want your mother to see it!

00:06:35.102 --> 00:06:37.730
<i>-Y-You're wrong!
- Oh, Tomoyo. What did you get?</i>

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:40.065
The same as the first term.

00:06:40.065 --> 00:06:42.526
That means you got really
good grades, doesn't it?

00:06:45.112 --> 00:06:47.448
Shaoran Li, Meilin Li.

00:06:47.865 --> 00:06:49.199
Herel!!

00:06:56.665 --> 00:06:59.668
Meilin is brimming
over with confidence.

00:06:59.668 --> 00:07:03.505
Yeah. Say, are you going somewhere
for winter vacation, Tomoyo?

00:07:03.505 --> 00:07:04.965
How?!

00:07:05.674 --> 00:07:08.427
Why didn't I get perfect grades?!

00:07:08.677 --> 00:07:13.682
Well, you're still new here from Hong Kong,
so your Japanese still needs work.

00:07:29.949 --> 00:07:32.910
What a relief. I can
show this to mother...

00:07:41.168 --> 00:07:43.462
You're really good
at schoolwork, Tomoyo!

00:07:43.462 --> 00:07:45.881
Oh, I'm not that good at it.

00:07:45.881 --> 00:07:47.007
Yes, you are.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:49.176
Let's see...

00:07:52.846 --> 00:07:54.431
Thank you.

00:07:56.225 --> 00:07:58.435
Are you going to use it
for winter homework?

00:07:58.435 --> 00:07:59.311
Yes!

00:08:00.062 --> 00:08:01.397
I know...

00:08:03.273 --> 00:08:05.401
Ta-dah! Draw one.

00:08:06.777 --> 00:08:10.489
It's a year-end event the
Tomoeda shopping district is having.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.158
The special prize is
a trip to Hong Kong.

00:08:13.158 --> 00:08:16.328
- Wow!
- Good luck, Sakural!

00:08:16.328 --> 00:08:17.287
Thanks!

00:08:18.789 --> 00:08:22.167
Many other children from Tomoeda
Elementary School also tried...

00:08:22.167 --> 00:08:24.086
...but they all got the small prizes.

00:08:28.382 --> 00:08:29.717
Huh?

00:08:29.717 --> 00:08:31.802
Huh? Um...

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:43.689
What color did you get?

00:08:44.732 --> 00:08:46.650
I guess I got the small prize, too.

00:08:50.029 --> 00:08:51.613
Let's see...

00:08:56.493 --> 00:08:57.995
The sp...

00:08:57.995 --> 00:08:59.663
Sp...

00:08:59.663 --> 00:09:00.372
Sp...?

00:09:00.372 --> 00:09:02.750
TRIP TO HONG KONG: 5 days, 4 nights

00:09:03.417 --> 00:09:05.127
SPECIAL PRIZE?!?

00:09:05.586 --> 00:09:08.505
- Ta-dah!
- This is amazing!!

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:12.551
An overseas trip, huh?

00:09:12.551 --> 00:09:14.887
It's winter vacation,
so the timing is perfect!

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:18.807
Exactly! I've never
been out of the country!

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:23.687
Ooh! Hong Kong, eh?!
That brings back memories...

00:09:23.687 --> 00:09:26.148
Kero, have you been to Hong Kong?

00:09:26.148 --> 00:09:28.609
Only for a short time.
I went with Clow.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:32.029
That means...

00:09:33.072 --> 00:09:36.909
...these Clow cards have
also been to Hong Kong!

00:09:37.659 --> 00:09:42.164
Yeah. Those cards were made
by the sorcerer, Clow Reed.

00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:47.336
I wonder what Hong Kong is like?

00:09:47.795 --> 00:09:51.173
Leave it to me! I'll take you
to all the best places!

00:09:51.381 --> 00:09:52.674
Okay!

00:09:55.677 --> 00:09:57.387
Oh? Wait...

00:09:57.554 --> 00:09:58.931
What's wrong?

00:09:59.348 --> 00:10:02.976
Isn't your dad going on a
business trip this winter vacation?

00:10:04.686 --> 00:10:06.605
Now that you mention it...

00:10:10.567 --> 00:10:12.069
You can go.

00:10:12.069 --> 00:10:13.070
Are you sure?

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:15.989
Sure. It would be a shame
to let the prize go to waste.

00:10:15.989 --> 00:10:19.660
And besides, even if I can't go,
Toya can go with you to look after you.

00:10:21.203 --> 00:10:23.413
But, big brother,
your part-time jobs...

00:10:30.504 --> 00:10:32.381
It'll cost you five chores.

00:10:34.007 --> 00:10:35.300
But you'll go?!

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:37.261
Okay, after that
there's Tomoyo, and...

00:10:37.261 --> 00:10:39.638
...how about bringing
Mr. Tsukishiro in my place?

00:10:41.515 --> 00:10:45.060
I think that would be all right.
He said he didn't have any plans.

00:10:47.271 --> 00:10:48.939
All right!

00:11:01.785 --> 00:11:03.871
I've never been on a plane before!

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.710
You brought your video camera...?

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:13.505
Yes! "Sakura in Hong Kong"!

00:11:13.755 --> 00:11:17.885
I wouldn't possibly lose such
a wonderful filming opportunity!

00:11:19.136 --> 00:11:23.015
And of course, I also brought
a costume to film you in!

00:11:23.307 --> 00:11:26.393
Please try it on when
we arrive in Hong Kong!

00:11:28.187 --> 00:11:30.522
Hey! It's time to board!

00:11:31.607 --> 00:11:33.025
- Okay!
- Okay!

00:11:37.529 --> 00:11:38.530
Hey.

00:11:39.489 --> 00:11:41.617
You have to take off your shoes
before boarding an airplane.

00:11:41.617 --> 00:11:43.285
What? Really?

00:11:51.335 --> 00:11:53.253
Miss, please step in as you are.

00:11:57.174 --> 00:11:58.717
Big brother?!

00:12:03.931 --> 00:12:06.225
I can't breathe!

00:12:07.059 --> 00:12:09.937
Hey, Sakura, aren't we there yet?

00:12:14.524 --> 00:12:17.194
- Be patient a little longer.
- Yeah, but...

00:12:17.778 --> 00:12:19.363
Sakura.

00:12:22.407 --> 00:12:24.618
Thanks for inviting me.

00:12:24.618 --> 00:12:29.539
I've never been overseas before.
I hope there's lots of fun in store!

00:12:31.833 --> 00:12:33.460
Me, too!

00:12:41.635 --> 00:12:43.220
Have a nice stay.

00:12:55.649 --> 00:12:57.234
Sakura...?!

00:12:59.861 --> 00:13:01.571
I'm sorry.

00:13:01.571 --> 00:13:04.157
You completely forgot
about me, didn't you?

00:13:05.826 --> 00:13:07.494
Don't giggle at me!

00:13:09.538 --> 00:13:11.915
Oh, well! Out of respect
for good old Hong Kong...

00:13:12.082 --> 00:13:14.167
...I'll let you off easy this time!

00:13:16.962 --> 00:13:18.755
Where are we?

00:13:19.673 --> 00:13:21.300
We're in Hong Kong.

00:13:22.968 --> 00:13:24.928
This is...

00:13:26.847 --> 00:13:28.932
...Hong Kong?!

00:13:42.404 --> 00:13:44.990
Hong Kong island is
really close, isn't it!

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:48.368
Yeah. It's only 5 minutes' ferry ride.

00:13:50.871 --> 00:13:54.875
Hey, if you lean out too far,
a shark will eat you.

00:13:54.875 --> 00:13:56.793
What? Are there sharks here?

00:13:58.128 --> 00:14:00.047
I read it in the guide book.

00:14:06.553 --> 00:14:08.347
Is it a shark?

00:14:11.892 --> 00:14:14.978
Sea gull, sea gull,
sea gull, sea gull!

00:14:15.604 --> 00:14:17.522
You're full of energy today,
too, aren't you, Sakura?

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:23.862
<i>U-Um... I like boats.</i>

00:14:24.988 --> 00:14:26.114
Me, too!

00:14:26.114 --> 00:14:28.784
Sakura, you're doing great!

00:14:29.826 --> 00:14:31.912
After that, film me, too!

00:14:31.912 --> 00:14:32.871
Okay.

00:14:48.136 --> 00:14:50.263
It really has changed!

00:14:50.806 --> 00:14:55.519
It was a long, long time ago when you
were in Hong Kong, wasn't it, Kero?

00:14:56.812 --> 00:14:58.605
Yeah, but...

00:14:59.481 --> 00:15:01.817
...the presence is the same.

00:15:01.817 --> 00:15:04.778
The presence of magic still remains,
the same as the old days.

00:15:04.778 --> 00:15:08.407
It may be diluted in Japan,
but here, it's nostalgic.

00:15:08.407 --> 00:15:10.033
Not only that, but...

00:15:13.495 --> 00:15:15.580
...the food is great!

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.417
Kero!

00:15:22.796 --> 00:15:24.548
Is something wrong?

00:15:25.382 --> 00:15:27.551
I'm worried about how Sakura
managed to win the special prize.

00:15:27.551 --> 00:15:29.428
She's bad at lotteries...

00:15:29.428 --> 00:15:30.929
What did you say?!

00:15:30.929 --> 00:15:32.848
Now, now, just listen!

00:15:33.974 --> 00:15:37.644
Clow's favorite theory was, "There
are no coincidences in this world."”

00:15:38.728 --> 00:15:42.691
There may be significance to
your winning the special prize.

00:15:43.942 --> 00:15:48.947
Or maybe not! Perhaps I've allowed the
atmosphere of Hong Kong to get to me!

00:16:10.177 --> 00:16:12.095
I'm here again...

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:55.430
Who's that?

00:17:41.601 --> 00:17:43.270
That dream again...

00:17:45.939 --> 00:17:47.857
I wonder who she is?

00:17:52.821 --> 00:17:55.699
I'll take four of those and
those, and four of those...

00:17:55.699 --> 00:17:57.492
...and then one of this
and one of that...!

00:17:59.661 --> 00:18:00.996
...for now.

00:18:01.705 --> 00:18:03.206
Okay, let's eat!

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:05.000
R- Right.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.169
Tomoyo, do you want
to go halves?

00:18:08.587 --> 00:18:09.671
Sure.

00:18:12.382 --> 00:18:14.259
Kero...!

00:18:15.218 --> 00:18:16.803
Kero?

00:18:18.013 --> 00:18:20.515
- I think I'll
try a different one!

00:18:20.807 --> 00:18:22.684
Does it have Keroppi
frog's legs in there?

00:18:22.684 --> 00:18:24.686
No, it's nothing.

00:18:26.354 --> 00:18:28.607
Which one do I want to try...?

00:18:29.316 --> 00:18:31.276
Give me the one you put back.

00:18:32.569 --> 00:18:36.323
But you have the same one near you!
Does it really matter which you have?

00:18:36.948 --> 00:18:38.658
I want that one.

00:18:38.658 --> 00:18:39.826
H- Hey!

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:41.161
But...

00:18:41.411 --> 00:18:44.039
I want that one.

00:19:02.349 --> 00:19:03.725
Hand it over already.

00:19:05.769 --> 00:19:06.770
Here!

00:19:11.441 --> 00:19:13.318
No, I'll eat it after all!

00:19:13.568 --> 00:19:15.862
Look, look! Doesn't it look good?!

00:19:15.862 --> 00:19:17.447
You're right!

00:19:17.614 --> 00:19:19.324
I'm sorry, big brother.

00:19:19.324 --> 00:19:21.951
- Toya...
- Yeah, yeah.

00:19:24.496 --> 00:19:27.207
After we're done eating,
next we're going to Bird Street.

00:19:27.916 --> 00:19:29.876
Bird Street?

00:19:29.876 --> 00:19:31.836
It's a place that's full of birds.

00:19:38.843 --> 00:19:42.013
Wow! It's full of bird cages!

00:19:43.306 --> 00:19:45.475
They say Hong Kong people
love birds so much...

00:19:45.475 --> 00:19:49.813
...they take their favorite birds
for walks in a cage to show them off.

00:19:49.813 --> 00:19:51.398
Really?

00:19:54.067 --> 00:19:55.902
Bird Street, huh?

00:19:55.902 --> 00:19:57.987
Are you familiar with it?

00:19:57.987 --> 00:20:00.949
This area doesn't seem to
have changed from the past.

00:20:03.868 --> 00:20:05.453
Cute!

00:20:25.056 --> 00:20:26.766
What's wrong?

00:20:26.766 --> 00:20:29.936
It felt like...
someone was watching me.

00:20:40.822 --> 00:20:42.866
I do sense an unusual presence.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:46.119
Do you think there are
Clow Cards in Hong Kong, too?

00:20:46.119 --> 00:20:49.247
No, it's a different presence.

00:20:49.497 --> 00:20:52.876
It's more, you know, evil...

00:20:53.835 --> 00:20:56.379
Huh? There are birds up there, too.

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:58.882
Maybe they escaped?

00:21:05.305 --> 00:21:06.973
Those birds!

00:21:10.643 --> 00:21:12.061
Sakural!

00:21:12.645 --> 00:21:14.564
We're going after them, too!

00:21:15.565 --> 00:21:17.192
Where did Sakura go?

00:21:17.192 --> 00:21:18.318
Hurry!

00:21:19.277 --> 00:21:21.029
We'll be right back.

00:21:41.633 --> 00:21:43.426
RELEASE!

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.055
JUMP!

00:21:59.651 --> 00:22:01.194
There they are!

00:22:18.503 --> 00:22:20.421
What is this feeling?

00:24:00.396 --> 00:24:02.315
Wake up!

00:24:13.493 --> 00:24:15.244
Li...?

00:24:16.037 --> 00:24:17.956
What are you doing here?

00:24:33.513 --> 00:24:36.891
I wonder where Sakura went?

00:24:42.730 --> 00:24:44.816
I'm sorry, are you all right?

00:24:47.735 --> 00:24:49.904
I'm fine, but...

00:24:50.405 --> 00:24:51.698
...is that Japanese?

00:24:52.615 --> 00:24:55.118
- Good afternoon.
- Daidouji!

00:24:56.577 --> 00:24:58.746
What are you doing in Hong Kong?

00:24:59.664 --> 00:25:03.793
Sakura won the special prize
in a draw. I came with her.

00:25:05.712 --> 00:25:07.588
Hello, brat!!

00:25:07.839 --> 00:25:09.882
Oh, the plush toy is with you.

00:25:09.882 --> 00:25:11.050
What?!

00:25:11.050 --> 00:25:12.927
Did you pass through quarantine?

00:25:12.927 --> 00:25:14.762
Say that again, I dare you!

00:25:18.599 --> 00:25:20.852
By the way, have you seen Shaoran?

00:25:21.686 --> 00:25:24.689
A minute ago, he suddenly said he sensed
a strange presence or something...

00:25:24.689 --> 00:25:26.566
...and ran off somewhere.

00:25:26.566 --> 00:25:29.485
I'm also looking for Sakura...

00:25:31.529 --> 00:25:32.947
Sakural!

00:25:35.283 --> 00:25:36.701
Shaoran!

00:25:37.910 --> 00:25:39.162
Tomoyo...

00:25:39.454 --> 00:25:42.874
What happened? Are you hurt?

00:25:43.499 --> 00:25:44.917
I'm okay.

00:25:45.334 --> 00:25:48.087
- Shaoran, where did you go?!
- My, you're soaked!

00:25:48.755 --> 00:25:50.298
Sakural!

00:25:56.179 --> 00:25:57.889
Where did you go by yourself?!

00:25:58.473 --> 00:26:02.477
I'm sorry. Um, I, um...

00:26:02.477 --> 00:26:04.896
I fell in a puddle and...

00:26:05.813 --> 00:26:07.231
And then...

00:26:07.231 --> 00:26:08.399
Sheesh.

00:26:09.817 --> 00:26:10.860
Huh?

00:26:11.319 --> 00:26:13.946
Hey, you don't have to be shy!

00:26:13.946 --> 00:26:14.906
Good afternoon.

00:26:14.906 --> 00:26:16.908
G- Good afternoon.

00:26:16.908 --> 00:26:18.409
Good afternoon!

00:26:19.869 --> 00:26:20.912
Ooh...!

00:26:21.954 --> 00:26:25.166
At any rate, you need to change
out of those wet clothes.

00:26:25.875 --> 00:26:27.210
Yeah...

00:26:58.157 --> 00:27:03.454
I can't believe my luck to be
able to film "China Sakura™

00:27:05.206 --> 00:27:08.084
You look really great in
a China dress, too, Tomoyo!

00:27:09.168 --> 00:27:11.420
Oh, thank you!

00:27:17.927 --> 00:27:20.179
Welcome!!

00:27:21.430 --> 00:27:23.641
- They're so cute!
- Yeah!

00:27:23.641 --> 00:27:25.351
Those really suit you!

00:27:26.102 --> 00:27:28.729
Not bad!

00:27:28.729 --> 00:27:30.356
You look good enough to eat!

00:27:30.356 --> 00:27:32.525
Definitely!!

00:27:32.525 --> 00:27:34.235
So cute!

00:27:34.235 --> 00:27:36.195
Who do you suppose they are?

00:27:36.195 --> 00:27:37.780
I- I dunno.

00:27:38.865 --> 00:27:41.409
How come we have to change, too?

00:27:41.409 --> 00:27:42.827
That really suits you, Toya.

00:27:42.827 --> 00:27:44.829
They're not bad, either...

00:27:44.829 --> 00:27:45.830
Not bad...

00:27:45.830 --> 00:27:47.123
They're good.

00:27:47.123 --> 00:27:48.583
Good...

00:27:52.420 --> 00:27:54.797
The porridge this morning was
really good, don't you think?

00:27:58.467 --> 00:28:00.386
- What's this?
- Beats me...

00:28:02.138 --> 00:28:04.056
What kind of girls do you like?

00:28:05.808 --> 00:28:07.894
I'll help, Shaoran.

00:28:07.894 --> 00:28:10.271
Li, are they your...?

00:28:10.271 --> 00:28:12.815
- They're his sisters.
- All four of them?

00:28:14.692 --> 00:28:15.818
Yeah.

00:28:18.905 --> 00:28:21.657
What cheerful sisters you have!

00:28:22.116 --> 00:28:24.702
What strange sisters you have.

00:28:25.244 --> 00:28:28.748
Kero! I'm sorry, Li.

00:28:45.264 --> 00:28:47.350
What a beautiful lady...

00:28:50.228 --> 00:28:52.021
- Pleased to meet you.
- Hello.

00:28:52.021 --> 00:28:53.481
Mother...

00:28:53.481 --> 00:28:55.149
What? Mother?

00:28:59.362 --> 00:29:01.822
- She looks very young.
- Yeah.

00:29:02.865 --> 00:29:05.201
She's like the head-
mistress of the freaks...

00:29:05.785 --> 00:29:07.370
Kero!

00:29:11.374 --> 00:29:13.751
He isn't denying it.

00:29:13.751 --> 00:29:15.002
<i>Y-Yeah.</i>

00:29:20.091 --> 00:29:23.135
P- Pleased to meet you.
My name is Sakura Kinomoto.

00:29:23.386 --> 00:29:26.013
Thank you for lending me
such wonderful clothes...

00:29:33.771 --> 00:29:38.985
I feel great power. You have
the Clow Cards, don't you.

00:29:49.161 --> 00:29:54.166
Great power may also serve as
an opportunity for hardship...

00:29:55.293 --> 00:29:57.378
...especially in Hong Kong.

00:30:04.760 --> 00:30:06.387
Stay the night.

00:30:07.471 --> 00:30:09.557
All right!!

00:30:14.770 --> 00:30:16.522
Shaoran...

00:30:18.774 --> 00:30:20.735
Show me your report card.

00:30:31.203 --> 00:30:34.707
For some reason, today was
really stressful, wasn't it!

00:30:39.086 --> 00:30:41.547
Li's mother is so pretty.

00:30:41.881 --> 00:30:44.008
Yeah, she's beautiful!

00:30:45.259 --> 00:30:48.554
She also has a feel
of mystery about her.

00:30:48.804 --> 00:30:50.306
That's true.

00:30:50.848 --> 00:30:54.143
Li's mother is also the
possessor of tremendous power.

00:30:54.769 --> 00:30:57.355
She is definitely a
descendent of Clow Reed.

00:30:57.355 --> 00:31:02.735
Clow's family on his mother's side
were famous sorcerers in China.

00:31:03.736 --> 00:31:07.448
Clow Reed was a very
famous sorcerer, wasn't he?

00:31:07.948 --> 00:31:10.409
Probably the strongest
at the time, yes.

00:31:11.077 --> 00:31:14.747
Still, Clow was twisted by nature,
so he had many enemies...

00:31:14.914 --> 00:31:16.916
Oh, my... Really?

00:31:25.549 --> 00:31:29.845
Still, had I known this would happen,
I would have taken a costume with me.

00:31:31.263 --> 00:31:34.600
When we return to the hotel,
please change into them, okay?

00:31:34.850 --> 00:31:36.394
R- Right.

00:31:36.727 --> 00:31:40.398
And then I'll film you flying
through the streets of Hong Kong...!

00:31:41.148 --> 00:31:43.234
Film me, too!

00:31:47.196 --> 00:31:48.739
Good night, Tomoyo.

00:31:48.989 --> 00:31:50.491
Good night.

00:32:09.718 --> 00:32:14.265
Great power may also serve as
an opportunity for hardship.

00:32:15.975 --> 00:32:18.060
Especially in Hong Kong.

00:32:37.037 --> 00:32:40.708
This dream again...

00:32:50.968 --> 00:32:52.887
Who are you?

00:32:58.225 --> 00:32:59.768
Who are you?

00:33:19.330 --> 00:33:21.707
I've waited for you forever...

00:33:26.045 --> 00:33:29.048
I've waited for you forever...

00:33:32.259 --> 00:33:35.763
I waited for a very long time...

00:33:36.096 --> 00:33:38.098
...for you alone.

00:33:59.578 --> 00:34:02.998
For a very long time, for you alone.

00:34:21.684 --> 00:34:24.228
What's wrong, Sakura?! Sakura!!

00:34:27.189 --> 00:34:28.857
Are you all right?

00:34:31.318 --> 00:34:32.653
A dream...

00:34:38.993 --> 00:34:41.203
This was no ordinary dream.

00:34:46.584 --> 00:34:47.626
Y-Yes?

00:35:07.563 --> 00:35:10.816
Jade emperor inquires,
please answer, four gods...

00:35:11.942 --> 00:35:16.739
Metal, wood, water, fire, earth,
lightning, wind, please answer...

00:35:17.156 --> 00:35:19.908
Jade emperor inquires,
please answer, four gods...

00:35:21.035 --> 00:35:23.454
God of Lightning and Wind, I ask you.

00:35:24.038 --> 00:35:26.373
Answer my inquiry through
this compass, God of Lightning.

00:35:26.874 --> 00:35:29.084
Bring forth to us
your words immediately!!

00:35:43.557 --> 00:35:46.852
It appears you were
beckoned to Hong Kong.

00:35:48.145 --> 00:35:49.605
By who?

00:35:56.487 --> 00:35:58.739
By the woman in your dream.

00:36:00.574 --> 00:36:06.455
Be careful. A danger incomparable
to dangers past approaches.

00:36:07.831 --> 00:36:09.958
What should I do?

00:36:11.251 --> 00:36:15.339
Only you know the path you must take.

00:36:16.715 --> 00:36:20.052
Those with great power are
susceptible to the temptation of evil.

00:36:21.011 --> 00:36:25.182
In particular, you are the holder
of the cards made by Clow Reed.

00:36:26.100 --> 00:36:29.186
The evil which beckons
will be all the greater.

00:36:33.399 --> 00:36:37.236
However, there is also
a guidance in such power.

00:36:41.490 --> 00:36:45.077
The evil which beckons
you is within a dream.

00:36:45.494 --> 00:36:48.580
The help you require
is also within a dream.

00:37:16.233 --> 00:37:20.738
It's all right. I know you are
capable of finding the answer.

00:37:34.376 --> 00:37:36.837
Oh, no! Are you going already?!

00:37:36.837 --> 00:37:38.672
Don't go! It's so lonely!

00:37:38.672 --> 00:37:41.467
Stay a while! Stay forever!

00:37:43.051 --> 00:37:45.512
You really did sleep over last night.

00:37:45.679 --> 00:37:46.972
Yes.

00:37:47.639 --> 00:37:49.600
I wish I'd slept over, too.

00:37:57.441 --> 00:38:00.819
Um, really,
thank you for everything.

00:38:14.208 --> 00:38:16.668
Hey, we're going soon!

00:38:17.294 --> 00:38:18.170
AWWWI!

00:38:18.170 --> 00:38:20.130
- Coming!
- Don't "Awww."

00:38:22.382 --> 00:38:24.051
Beware of water.

00:38:25.761 --> 00:38:27.346
Water?

00:38:30.015 --> 00:38:33.310
The thing in the middle that looks
like a knife is the Bank of China.

00:38:33.310 --> 00:38:36.063
And the building with the roof
designed like a giant cannon...

00:38:36.063 --> 00:38:37.981
...Is the Hong Kong Shanghai Bank!

00:38:38.816 --> 00:38:43.654
This is Hong Kong's economic core.
The two banks are rivals.

00:38:44.279 --> 00:38:45.280
I see.

00:38:46.156 --> 00:38:50.744
As I feared, you didn't come to Hong Kong
by coincidence after all, Sakura.

00:38:55.123 --> 00:38:57.626
Does that mean the person in my dream...

00:38:57.835 --> 00:39:00.712
...Is responsible for my
winning the draw, as well?

00:39:01.296 --> 00:39:05.092
Do you suppose anybody is
capable of such a thing?

00:39:05.759 --> 00:39:10.514
I don't know, but if
there is, why Sakura?

00:39:21.859 --> 00:39:25.070
Why do we have to go with them?!

00:39:25.445 --> 00:39:29.032
I have no choice. Mom told me to.

00:39:29.032 --> 00:39:31.326
She asked you to give
them a guided tour?

00:39:31.743 --> 00:39:34.037
- No...
- Then what?!

00:39:36.206 --> 00:39:38.584
Some kind of danger
seems to be approaching.

00:39:45.591 --> 00:39:47.009
Pretty...!

00:39:49.720 --> 00:39:53.515
Now that I think about it,
the lady in my dream...

00:39:53.974 --> 00:39:56.143
...also had a pretty hair ornament...

00:40:01.398 --> 00:40:03.108
It's pretty, isn't it!

00:40:03.859 --> 00:40:05.193
Here.

00:40:13.660 --> 00:40:14.703
I'll take this.

00:40:14.995 --> 00:40:18.123
Huh? B- But, you can't! I... Uh...!

00:40:19.041 --> 00:40:21.168
Yukito, I...!

00:40:21.585 --> 00:40:22.628
Here.

00:40:24.880 --> 00:40:26.340
I'm sure it'll look good on you.

00:40:30.260 --> 00:40:32.220
Th- Thank you so much!

00:40:35.807 --> 00:40:37.684
What's wrong?

00:40:38.310 --> 00:40:40.395
Nothing.

00:40:53.325 --> 00:40:54.826
Sakura?

00:40:54.826 --> 00:40:56.411
Hey, Sakura!

00:40:58.413 --> 00:40:59.998
That idiot!

00:41:15.055 --> 00:41:16.640
Jeez!

00:41:20.936 --> 00:41:23.021
Kero, you can come out now!

00:41:24.398 --> 00:41:28.443
I sense evil! Really powerful evil!!

00:41:28.443 --> 00:41:29.403
Yeah!

00:41:35.701 --> 00:41:38.203
Are those the birds
that appeared in your dream?

00:41:38.203 --> 00:41:39.663
Yeah!

00:41:40.122 --> 00:41:42.416
Those are no ordinary birds.

00:41:42.582 --> 00:41:45.877
Be careful. They have
incredibly strong magic!

00:42:00.434 --> 00:42:02.185
Do they want me to come in?

00:42:02.561 --> 00:42:03.979
Looks like it.

00:42:39.431 --> 00:42:42.059
- Nobody's here.
- Yeah...

00:42:44.561 --> 00:42:45.729
What's wrong?

00:42:46.188 --> 00:42:47.981
Do you hear water?

00:42:55.280 --> 00:42:56.990
I hear it.

00:43:11.254 --> 00:43:13.090
It's coming from this book.

00:43:34.611 --> 00:43:36.530
This lady...!

00:43:46.665 --> 00:43:48.333
Hey, Sakura! What are you...?!

00:43:52.629 --> 00:43:54.339
Come...

00:44:01.012 --> 00:44:03.306
Sakura, snap out of it!!

00:44:05.308 --> 00:44:06.852
Come...

00:44:12.858 --> 00:44:15.569
Come here...

00:44:21.241 --> 00:44:22.993
I have no choice...

00:44:24.035 --> 00:44:25.579
Sakural!

00:44:27.497 --> 00:44:30.584
You...! We've been
looking everywhere for you!!

00:44:31.751 --> 00:44:33.295
This presence...

00:44:36.548 --> 00:44:38.049
Sakura?

00:44:53.940 --> 00:44:56.193
Sakura, what's wrong with you?! Hey!!

00:45:03.325 --> 00:45:04.868
<i>W-What is this?</i>

00:45:46.201 --> 00:45:48.453
- Are you okay?
- Kero...

00:45:48.745 --> 00:45:51.206
It looks like you've
returned to your senses.

00:45:51.373 --> 00:45:53.833
Say, are we inside a dream?!

00:45:53.833 --> 00:45:55.627
It's no dream.

00:46:09.891 --> 00:46:13.186
This is a world
I created from magic.

00:46:16.648 --> 00:46:18.525
Why aren't you him?

00:46:18.942 --> 00:46:21.403
You're the one in the book!

00:46:21.403 --> 00:46:25.031
Why did a little brat
like you come here?!?

00:46:39.796 --> 00:46:41.423
Answer me!

00:46:41.631 --> 00:46:43.425
- Sakura!
- Right!

00:46:45.844 --> 00:46:47.178
FLY!

00:46:47.178 --> 00:46:48.596
A Clow Card...?

00:46:49.848 --> 00:46:52.892
Why do you have a Clow Card?!

00:47:06.573 --> 00:47:09.701
I think she knows
about the Clow Cards!

00:47:09.701 --> 00:47:10.744
Yeah...

00:47:10.994 --> 00:47:12.662
Sakura! Front!

00:47:23.173 --> 00:47:24.799
FREEZE!

00:47:30.930 --> 00:47:32.015
A Clow Card?!

00:47:35.894 --> 00:47:37.103
Li!

00:47:39.064 --> 00:47:41.191
You have a Clow Card, too?!

00:47:42.484 --> 00:47:43.777
What are you doing here?

00:47:44.027 --> 00:47:46.738
After I was swallowed by water,
the next thing I knew I was here.

00:47:46.946 --> 00:47:48.865
That means everyone
who was with us...

00:47:49.074 --> 00:47:50.950
They must be here somewhere.

00:47:51.242 --> 00:47:52.869
We have to find them, quick!

00:47:53.995 --> 00:47:55.914
You needn't bother looking!

00:47:57.624 --> 00:48:01.503
The ones I brought in
with you are over there.

00:48:18.269 --> 00:48:22.982
I called Clow Reed...
...not you. Why are you here?

00:48:24.984 --> 00:48:27.737
I could swear I've met
that lady before somewhere...

00:48:28.238 --> 00:48:30.156
Where is Clow Reed?!

00:48:31.908 --> 00:48:33.827
We're going to split up.

00:48:34.369 --> 00:48:39.040
I'll keep her busy while you
get everyone out of here.

00:48:39.457 --> 00:48:40.542
Right.

00:48:41.126 --> 00:48:43.169
WHERE IS CLOW REED?!?

00:48:46.339 --> 00:48:48.091
- Go!
- Right!

00:48:54.848 --> 00:48:56.516
STORM!

00:49:11.573 --> 00:49:13.199
SWORD!

00:49:27.172 --> 00:49:28.882
FLY!

00:49:30.425 --> 00:49:31.801
Kero!

00:49:36.764 --> 00:49:39.767
Meilin... Big brother...

00:49:41.936 --> 00:49:43.730
Yukito...

00:49:45.064 --> 00:49:47.609
Hold on! I'll be right back!

00:49:48.735 --> 00:49:50.612
- Sakura, hurry!
- Right!

00:50:04.918 --> 00:50:07.003
Damn! It's no good!

00:50:11.966 --> 00:50:14.135
Are you awake, Tomoyo?!

00:50:14.802 --> 00:50:16.429
Thank goodness!

00:50:19.265 --> 00:50:22.018
What happened to me...?
Where are we?

00:50:22.310 --> 00:50:23.937
We'll explain later!

00:50:24.312 --> 00:50:25.063
Yeah.

00:50:39.869 --> 00:50:41.454
You...!

00:50:42.789 --> 00:50:44.541
You are unforgivable!

00:50:50.338 --> 00:50:51.923
Unforgivable!

00:50:56.803 --> 00:50:58.179
Kero, you stay here!

00:50:58.179 --> 00:50:59.222
- Sakura!
- Sakura!

00:51:03.560 --> 00:51:05.395
Li! Li!

00:51:06.396 --> 00:51:09.357
Li, say something!!

00:51:10.149 --> 00:51:11.901
R- Run!

00:51:17.782 --> 00:51:19.450
You have to run!

00:51:26.416 --> 00:51:29.002
Stay back! You have
to save yourselves!

00:51:29.586 --> 00:51:30.878
But...!

00:51:33.673 --> 00:51:38.219
Her magic is weaker above. If you fly
above her, you should be able to get out.

00:51:38.219 --> 00:51:39.596
Silence!

00:51:40.763 --> 00:51:42.348
Li?!

00:51:49.772 --> 00:51:53.985
If Clow Reed will not come, I will
simply have to steal your power...

00:51:54.277 --> 00:51:56.904
...and leave to hunt for him myself!.

00:51:57.572 --> 00:51:59.949
You will join them
to become a part of me!

00:52:11.002 --> 00:52:13.212
Sakura! For now, we
have to get out of here!

00:52:15.340 --> 00:52:16.966
Run...

00:52:17.759 --> 00:52:20.637
At this rate, everyone
will be captured...!

00:52:20.803 --> 00:52:22.347
Sakura?!

00:52:43.660 --> 00:52:45.495
Curse you! You will not escape!

00:52:53.711 --> 00:52:55.296
That's the exit!

00:53:37.296 --> 00:53:38.840
Sakura...

00:53:40.800 --> 00:53:43.010
Because of me, everyone was...

00:53:43.386 --> 00:53:47.640
It's not your fault! The woman in
the book is to blame for all of it!

00:53:48.808 --> 00:53:50.017
Book...?

00:53:50.435 --> 00:53:52.979
- The book!
- Now that I think about it...

00:53:55.690 --> 00:53:56.482
Book?

00:53:56.482 --> 00:53:58.526
You probably didn't
realize it, Tomoyo...

00:53:58.526 --> 00:54:02.155
...but we were just inside
the world of a book!

00:54:02.822 --> 00:54:05.867
So, if we have that book,
we can save everyone?

00:54:06.325 --> 00:54:08.202
What kind of a book is it?

00:54:08.202 --> 00:54:09.454
It was...

00:54:09.954 --> 00:54:13.249
...kind of old with
a strange presence about it...

00:54:14.917 --> 00:54:16.836
The presence is gone!

00:54:18.087 --> 00:54:21.507
It's not here. It's
nowhere to be found!

00:54:22.967 --> 00:54:24.385
Sakura...

00:54:26.137 --> 00:54:30.349
Li... Meilin...

00:54:30.516 --> 00:54:32.268
Big brother...

00:54:33.895 --> 00:54:35.646
Yukito...

00:54:36.773 --> 00:54:41.527
Pull yourself together! At any rate,
we have to try to stop that sorceress...!

00:54:43.488 --> 00:54:47.241
That woman!! I just remembered!

00:54:49.619 --> 00:54:53.080
Is someone here?
I'll be right with you!

00:54:53.456 --> 00:54:55.041
Somebody's coming!

00:54:55.208 --> 00:54:57.502
- For now, let's get out of here!
-Y- Yeah...

00:54:57.502 --> 00:55:01.297
Miss, are you Japanese?
Can I help you find something?

00:55:06.844 --> 00:55:11.724
A long time ago, that woman was
a fortune-teller here in Hong Kong.

00:55:12.308 --> 00:55:13.142
A fortune-teller?

00:55:13.351 --> 00:55:16.646
Yes. If memory serves, I believe
she was a water fortune-teller.

00:55:17.396 --> 00:55:20.566
She would make various things
appear on the water's surface...

00:55:20.983 --> 00:55:23.611
...and she had quite
a good reputation, but...

00:55:24.487 --> 00:55:25.530
But?

00:55:26.781 --> 00:55:29.534
One day, Clow Reed showed up.

00:55:31.744 --> 00:55:34.080
Clow wasn't really a fortune teller.

00:55:34.330 --> 00:55:38.084
Still, the tellings he performed in
his leisure time were very accurate...

00:55:38.084 --> 00:55:41.462
...So the lady's business took a dive.

00:55:41.462 --> 00:55:42.588
Oh, my...

00:55:42.922 --> 00:55:47.468
After that, she began challenging
Clow to fights at every opportunity.

00:55:48.594 --> 00:55:53.391
But if she's lived so far in the past,
shouldn't she be gone now?

00:55:54.267 --> 00:55:55.351
It's her magic!

00:55:55.601 --> 00:55:56.602
Her magic?

00:55:56.894 --> 00:56:01.107
After she died, she transferred
her own hatred into that book.

00:56:01.566 --> 00:56:03.442
It's horribly difficult magic...

00:56:03.609 --> 00:56:07.697
...to make it last for decades, it
would require extraordinary willpower.

00:56:08.739 --> 00:56:13.202
I bet that she doesn't even
fully realize that she's dead now...

00:56:14.120 --> 00:56:17.164
That lady must have really hated Clow.

00:56:18.291 --> 00:56:21.252
So, what was she hoping
to do with that magic?

00:56:21.252 --> 00:56:25.172
She probably wanted to
confine Clow inside the book.

00:56:25.172 --> 00:56:29.719
So, Sakura was drawn into it
because she has the Clow Cards?

00:56:30.177 --> 00:56:35.933
But how do I get inside the book again?!
If I don't hurry, everyone will be...

00:56:37.768 --> 00:56:42.106
A dimension like that should
have an entrance somewhere...

00:56:43.065 --> 00:56:46.652
...but the presence had already
disappeared from that store.

00:56:47.194 --> 00:56:49.989
The book disappeared, too...

00:56:53.868 --> 00:56:55.244
The book...

00:56:58.080 --> 00:57:02.001
I know the cover of that book.

00:57:02.209 --> 00:57:03.753
Huh?

00:57:06.047 --> 00:57:08.090
I know where she lived.

00:57:13.763 --> 00:57:15.681
It's that well.

00:57:22.188 --> 00:57:24.398
Sakura, did you figure out something?!

00:57:24.398 --> 00:57:29.028
Yeah! I know where the entrance is!
I almost went through it yesterday!

00:57:29.028 --> 00:57:31.989
That means you can go
to where everyone is!

00:57:32.156 --> 00:57:32.907
Yeah!

00:57:32.907 --> 00:57:35.952
All right! It's time for
Cardcaptor Sakura!!

00:57:36.702 --> 00:57:37.620
Yeah!

00:57:38.245 --> 00:57:40.331
Very well, it's time
to put on your costume!

00:57:56.847 --> 00:57:58.224
Is this the place?

00:57:58.224 --> 00:57:59.684
Yeah!

00:57:59.684 --> 00:58:02.269
I definitely feel a life force
like electricity in the air...

00:58:19.036 --> 00:58:20.454
Sakural!

00:58:21.038 --> 00:58:22.289
What's happening?!

00:58:22.289 --> 00:58:25.042
- This is a barrier!
- A barrier?

00:58:25.251 --> 00:58:28.254
A powerful barrier has been
positioned around the well.

00:58:29.296 --> 00:58:31.257
What should we do?

00:58:31.632 --> 00:58:35.636
I hate to admit it, but at our current
strength, there's nothing we can do.

00:58:36.929 --> 00:58:38.597
But that can't be...

00:58:41.642 --> 00:58:43.561
What is it?

00:58:43.561 --> 00:58:45.312
Somebody's coming!

00:58:49.608 --> 00:58:51.569
- Over here.
- R- Right.

00:59:04.040 --> 00:59:05.833
Li's mother!

00:59:09.962 --> 00:59:11.714
Stand back.

00:59:14.550 --> 00:59:16.469
Um, how did you know?

00:59:18.596 --> 00:59:21.015
Shaoran's life force was interrupted.

00:59:22.600 --> 00:59:24.518
That's because I...

00:59:25.603 --> 00:59:27.521
No, you are not to blame.

00:59:29.148 --> 00:59:32.318
He merely was no match for its power.

00:59:43.079 --> 00:59:44.830
That's powerful magic!

01:00:00.930 --> 01:00:02.389
Now go.

01:00:02.389 --> 01:00:05.601
R- Right! Tomoyo, wait here.

01:00:05.601 --> 01:00:07.269
Sakural!

01:00:08.687 --> 01:00:10.648
Be careful, okay?!

01:00:10.648 --> 01:00:12.233
I will!

01:00:12.650 --> 01:00:15.778
These clothes are
really easy to move in!

01:00:17.446 --> 01:00:21.951
They're completely waterproofed,
so you'll be all right inside water.

01:00:37.049 --> 01:00:38.717
Sakura...

01:01:03.117 --> 01:01:04.660
Where is this?

01:01:05.202 --> 01:01:07.872
It's the dimensional tunnel.
Look well around you!

01:01:09.415 --> 01:01:11.750
It links up to all kinds of dimensions.

01:01:11.750 --> 01:01:14.545
If you get lost, you'll be
stuck in here your entire life!!

01:01:14.545 --> 01:01:16.046
What should I do?

01:01:16.046 --> 01:01:18.007
- Love!
- Huh?

01:01:18.591 --> 01:01:20.843
With your powerful feelings of love...

01:01:20.843 --> 01:01:23.137
...you should be able to
exit in the right place!

01:01:25.598 --> 01:01:27.474
Take me to where everyone is!

01:01:29.351 --> 01:01:30.936
There it is!!

01:01:42.531 --> 01:01:44.450
This isn't it...

01:01:44.450 --> 01:01:47.912
What'II we do? I think
we took the wrong exit.

01:01:47.912 --> 01:01:49.997
No, this presence...

01:01:53.584 --> 01:01:55.502
- That way!!
- Yeah!

01:02:10.976 --> 01:02:12.937
Bird Street?

01:02:12.937 --> 01:02:16.190
It appears all kinds of
dimensions are mixed up here.

01:02:16.899 --> 01:02:18.859
- Let's go!!
- Right!

01:02:37.211 --> 01:02:39.546
Her presence is growing
stronger and stronger!

01:02:39.546 --> 01:02:41.131
She's close!!

01:02:55.896 --> 01:02:57.898
I sense her here.

01:02:57.898 --> 01:02:59.483
Yeah...

01:03:13.998 --> 01:03:15.708
Sakura.

01:03:15.708 --> 01:03:17.376
Right!

01:03:46.113 --> 01:03:49.116
You again... Why did you return?

01:03:49.116 --> 01:03:51.535
Please! Please let everyone go!

01:03:52.953 --> 01:03:56.874
If you want them back,
bring me Clow Reed.

01:03:57.624 --> 01:04:01.378
We couldn't bring him here even
if we wanted to! Clow is long...

01:04:01.920 --> 01:04:03.964
I waited forever.

01:04:07.468 --> 01:04:10.596
I waited forever for Clow
to come... forever!

01:04:12.598 --> 01:04:16.143
Pay attention when people
are talking to you! Jeez!!

01:04:16.935 --> 01:04:18.687
That lady...

01:04:24.902 --> 01:04:26.403
Wh- What?!

01:04:51.387 --> 01:04:52.971
Everyone!

01:04:56.683 --> 01:05:00.521
This is the last time.
Where is Clow Reed?

01:05:01.939 --> 01:05:05.484
I'm trying to tell you that
he's not with us anymore!

01:05:06.568 --> 01:05:09.321
Very well, then you
can die in this place!!

01:05:46.400 --> 01:05:48.068
Where am 7!

01:06:02.166 --> 01:06:03.834
- Sakura!
- Right!

01:06:10.257 --> 01:06:14.761
The Key which hides powers of the Dark!
Show your true form before me!

01:06:16.346 --> 01:06:19.057
I, Sakura, command you
under our contract!

01:06:19.224 --> 01:06:21.059
RELEASE!

01:06:32.863 --> 01:06:34.406
FLY!

01:06:35.699 --> 01:06:37.242
Sakura...!

01:06:40.204 --> 01:06:41.997
She's coming.

01:06:55.761 --> 01:06:57.763
Where is she?!

01:06:57.763 --> 01:06:59.348
Above!

01:07:10.484 --> 01:07:13.737
Where is this?! What have
you done with Clow Reed?!?

01:07:16.865 --> 01:07:18.617
Mr. Clow is gone!

01:07:33.423 --> 01:07:37.052
Sakura! Running away
will get us nowhere!

01:07:37.052 --> 01:07:38.971
But if I do anything,
everyone will be...!!

01:07:46.061 --> 01:07:47.813
Sakura...!!

01:08:00.534 --> 01:08:03.203
Talk! Where is Clow Reed?!

01:08:04.788 --> 01:08:07.249
Mr. Clow isn't alive anymore.

01:08:08.208 --> 01:08:09.459
Liar!!

01:08:09.835 --> 01:08:12.546
It's true! He died a long time ago!

01:08:12.796 --> 01:08:13.672
You're lying!!

01:08:19.094 --> 01:08:21.138
He would never die.

01:08:22.306 --> 01:08:24.266
Not Clow Reed...

01:08:38.864 --> 01:08:40.824
Clow Reed would never...!!

01:08:45.370 --> 01:08:47.914
HE WOULD NEVER DIE!!

01:09:08.310 --> 01:09:10.312
I waited forever for him...

01:09:12.064 --> 01:09:13.982
...forever.

01:09:25.952 --> 01:09:29.956
I never stopped beckoning to him
with all my strength...

01:09:32.000 --> 01:09:36.088
No matter how many years...
no matter how many decades it took...

01:10:14.376 --> 01:10:17.087
I have no reason
to accept this thing!

01:10:17.087 --> 01:10:19.965
Today is your birthday, isn't it?

01:10:24.636 --> 01:10:26.972
That is a gift to you.

01:10:28.014 --> 01:10:29.975
If you do not want it,
please throw it away.

01:10:56.877 --> 01:10:59.546
I thought so. She actually...

01:11:15.771 --> 01:11:19.107
Water is a thing that flows.

01:11:21.777 --> 01:11:25.030
Water... flows?

01:11:36.541 --> 01:11:37.709
That's it!

01:11:41.963 --> 01:11:43.673
ARROW!

01:12:22.921 --> 01:12:24.631
Curse you...!

01:12:39.437 --> 01:12:43.483
You really loved Mr. Clow, didn't you?

01:12:48.321 --> 01:12:50.323
It hurts, doesn't it...?

01:12:54.369 --> 01:12:56.872
It hurts to lose someone you love.

01:12:59.916 --> 01:13:01.835
It hurts, doesn't it?

01:13:10.468 --> 01:13:13.805
Is Clow Reed really dead?

01:13:27.903 --> 01:13:31.615
I waited for him
forever... Forever...

01:13:51.134 --> 01:13:54.596
For such a long time...

01:14:08.652 --> 01:14:13.698
I wanted to see him...
to tell him something...

01:14:53.613 --> 01:14:56.908
Water is a thing that flows.

01:15:00.537 --> 01:15:03.581
That voice was Mr. Clow...

01:15:25.228 --> 01:15:26.479
Li...!

01:15:26.688 --> 01:15:29.274
Meilin... big brother...

01:15:31.067 --> 01:15:32.861
Yukito...!

01:15:46.708 --> 01:15:50.211
What do you think would
make a good souvenir for Dad?

01:15:50.503 --> 01:15:52.338
How about tea or something?

01:15:52.338 --> 01:15:53.423
Tea?

01:15:58.178 --> 01:16:01.014
It's already time to go
back to Japan tomorrow.

01:16:01.931 --> 01:16:03.391
Yeah.

01:16:04.517 --> 01:16:08.396
Yeah, this trip has been hell!
Especially yesterday.

01:16:09.189 --> 01:16:10.815
Not really.

01:16:12.776 --> 01:16:16.362
I also want to say how I really feel...

01:16:16.738 --> 01:16:18.698
...want the one I love to know.

01:16:21.076 --> 01:16:24.871
She wanted to say
something to Mr. Clow.

01:16:25.663 --> 01:16:27.749
Something she was
desperate to tell him.

01:16:35.298 --> 01:16:38.510
I hope I can tell him someday.

01:16:42.222 --> 01:16:45.391
I hope we can come to
Hong Kong again someday.

01:16:47.268 --> 01:16:48.353
Yeah!!

01:16:52.148 --> 01:16:56.069
That song I loved...
Daisuki datta ano uta...

01:16:57.529 --> 01:17:01.866
In the old tape...
Furui teepu no naka...

01:17:02.242 --> 01:17:08.456
Small scratches, a faded title...
Chiisana kizu, iroaseta taitoru...

01:17:08.456 --> 01:17:11.459
Blurred sunrise.
Nijinda yoake.

01:17:12.418 --> 01:17:16.506
And then today will come again...
Soshite mata kyou ga kuru...

01:17:18.007 --> 01:17:21.845
Bringing summer's breeze.
Natsu no kaze wo tsurete.

01:17:22.637 --> 01:17:27.559
In a corner of days becoming familiar...
Nareteyuku hibi no katasumi de...

01:17:27.559 --> 01:17:31.980
I suddenly meet loneliness.
Futo kodoku ni deau.

01:17:33.231 --> 01:17:43.366
I will not forget the speed...
Jitensha de dokomademo...

01:17:43.366 --> 01:17:49.038
So fast, it plows through the wind...
Kaze wo keru hayasa...

01:17:49.038 --> 01:17:53.042
On a bicycle to anywhere.
Wasurenai.

01:17:54.294 --> 01:17:58.214
<i>La Ia la la, let's sing...
La la la Ia, utaou...</i>

01:17:58.214 --> 01:18:03.553
Looking up at the sky.
Sora wo miagete.

01:18:04.554 --> 01:18:08.558
<i>La la la Ia, it's my life...
La la la Ia, it's my life...</i>

01:18:08.558 --> 01:18:13.521
Let's keep walking.
Aruite yukou.

01:18:13.855 --> 01:18:18.985
Going forward with my power...
Watashi no chikara de susumu...

01:18:18.985 --> 01:18:24.532
On this endless road.
Hateshinai kono michi wo.

01:18:26.534 --> 01:18:30.413
Countless crosswalks...
Ikutsumo no kousaten:...

01:18:31.956 --> 01:18:35.752
I always get lost, but...
ltsumo ma you kedo...

01:18:36.836 --> 01:18:42.967
Being pushed along or left behind...
Nagasaretari oikosaretari shite...

01:18:42.967 --> 01:18:45.929
And I am living in the present.
Ima wo ikiteru.

01:18:47.180 --> 01:18:57.106
I will not forget facing a task...
Butsukaru koto, mitomeru koto...

01:18:57.523 --> 01:19:02.987
Or facing up to the facts...
Otona ni naftemo...

01:19:02.987 --> 01:19:06.658
Even when I am grown.
Wasurenai.

01:19:08.201 --> 01:19:12.121
<i>La Ia la la, let's sing...
La la la Ia, utaou...</i>

01:19:12.121 --> 01:19:17.627
Looking up at the sky.
Sora wo miagete.

01:19:18.503 --> 01:19:22.548
<i>La la la Ia, it's my life...
La la la Ia, it's my life...</i>

01:19:22.548 --> 01:19:27.679
Let's keep walking.
Aruite yukou.

01:19:27.679 --> 01:19:32.517
It belongs to me alone, so...
Watashi dake no mono dakara...

01:19:32.934 --> 01:19:38.106
I can have confidence, right?
Jishin motte ii yo ne?

01:19:57.000 --> 01:19:59.627
In the city of my birth...
Umareta machi de...

01:19:59.627 --> 01:20:01.754
I have had many dreams...
yume mite kita...

01:20:01.754 --> 01:20:06.634
With every frustration, I remember...
Kujikeru tabi ni omoidasu...

01:20:06.634 --> 01:20:09.429
That just like that song says...
Ano uta no youni

01:20:09.429 --> 01:20:11.889
What I can do now...
ima dekiru koto wa...

01:20:11.889 --> 01:20:18.313
Is to step forward, if only a little.
Sukoshi demo maeni fumidasu kofo.

01:20:20.023 --> 01:20:24.027
<i>La Ia la la, let's sing...
La la la Ia, utaou...</i>

01:20:24.027 --> 01:20:29.741
Looking up at the sky.
Sora wo miagete.

01:20:30.241 --> 01:20:34.245
<i>La la la Ia, it's my life...
La la la Ia, it's my life...</i>

01:20:34.245 --> 01:20:40.043
Let's keep walking.
Aruite yukou.

01:20:40.376 --> 01:20:44.630
<i>La Ia la la, let's sing...
La la la Ia, utaou...</i>

01:20:44.630 --> 01:20:49.969
Looking up at the sky.
Sora wo miagete.

01:20:50.553 --> 01:20:54.849
<i>La la la Ia, it's my life...
La la la Ia, it's my life...</i>

01:20:54.849 --> 01:20:59.395
Let's keep walking.
Aruite yukou.

01:20:59.771 --> 01:21:04.859
Going forward with my power...
Watashi no chikara de susumu...

01:21:04.859 --> 01:21:11.366
On this endless road.
Hateshinai kono michi wo.
